WEBVTT

00:08:59.341 --> 00:09:03.976
Nikatambua ya kwamba nimezama sana katika habari zinazoelezea watu wa Mexico

00:09:04.000 --> 00:09:06.000
ambao wamekuwa jambo katika akili yangu,

00:09:06.024 --> 00:09:07.849
wahamiaji duni,

00:09:08.769 --> 00:09:11.191
nilidanganyika katika hadithi moja
ya watu wa Mexico

00:09:11.215 --> 00:09:13.722
na sikuweza kujisikia aibu zaidi.

00:09:14.071 --> 00:09:16.618
Kwa hiyo hiyo ndiyo
namna ya kutengeneza hadithi moja.

00:09:16.642 --> 00:09:18.976
kuwaeleza watu kama jambo moja,

00:09:19.000 --> 00:09:20.976
kama jambo moja tu,

00:09:21.000 --> 00:09:22.976
tena na tena,

00:09:23.000 --> 00:09:24.515
na hivyo ndivyo watakavyokuwa.

00:09:25.793 --> 00:09:28.239
Haiwezekani kuongelea kuhusu hadithi moja

00:09:28.263 --> 00:09:29.952
bila kuongelea kuhusu uwezo ya mamlaka.